---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard.astro';
import {projects,products} from '../lib/catalog';
const picks=[...projects.filter(p=>p.featured),...projects.filter(p=>!p.featured)].slice(0,3);
const components=products.filter(p=>p.featured).slice(0,4);
---
<BaseLayout title="MAKHEX — Build something real" description="ESP32 maker projects, mapped hardware components, build notes and an open maker community.">
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-inner">
<div class="hero-copy"><div class="hero-kicker"><span class="live-dot"></span> THE OPEN MAKER WORKSHOP <span class="kicker-rule"></span> EST. 2026</div>
<h1>BUILD<br/>SOMETHING<br/><em>REAL<span class="period">.</span></em></h1>
<p class="hero-lede">The best hardware starts as a wild idea. We turn it into a build guide, map the parts, and share what actually works.</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/projects/">EXPLORE PROJECTS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/shop/">BROWSE COMPONENTS <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
<div class="hero-footnote"><span class="tiny-square"></span> ESP32 / OPEN SOURCE / HANDS-ON LEARNING</div></div>
<div class="hero-panel" aria-label="Decorative ESP32 circuit concept illustration"><div class="panel-grid"></div><div class="panel-top"><span>MAKHEX / WORKBENCH 01</span><span class="panel-status"><i></i> ACTIVE</span></div>
<div class="hero-circuit"><div class="circuit-track top-left"></div><div class="circuit-track top-right"></div><div class="circuit-track bottom-left"></div><div class="circuit-track bottom-right"></div>
<div class="circuit-core"><div class="core-label">ESP<span>32</span><small>IDEAS → OBJECTS</small></div><div class="core-led"></div></div>
<span class="trace-dot dot-a"></span><span class="trace-dot dot-b"></span><span class="trace-dot dot-c"></span><span class="trace-dot dot-d"></span><span class="circuit-coordinate left">GPIO_17</span><span class="circuit-coordinate right">STATUS_01</span></div>
<div class="panel-bottom"><div><span class="eyebrow">NOW ASSEMBLING</span><strong>THE NEXT GENERATION<br/>OF MAKER PROJECTS.</strong></div><span>∎∎∎ 011001</span></div></div></div>
<div class="container hero-numbers"><div><strong>10</strong><span>PROJECT BLUEPRINTS</span></div><div><strong>12</strong><span>COMPONENT CANDIDATES</span></div><div><strong>01</strong><span>OPEN MAKER COMMUNITY</span></div><p>EVERY BUILD STARTS SOMEWHERE ↘</p></div></section>
<div class="ticker"><div class="ticker-content">CODE IT <b>✳</b> WIRE IT <b>✳</b> BREAK IT <b>✳</b> FIX IT <b>✳</b> SHARE IT <b>✳</b> CODE IT <b>✳</b> WIRE IT <b>✳</b> BREAK IT <b>✳</b> FIX IT <b>✳</b> SHARE IT <b>✳</b></div></div>
<section class="section section-projects"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / THE LAB</span><h2>Ideas worth<br/><em>building.</em></h2></div><div class="section-side"><p>Each build maps to components, a clear outcome, and an honest list of what needs testing.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">VIEW ALL 10 PROJECTS ↗</a></div></div>
<div class="project-grid">{picks.map(p=><ProjectCard project={p}/>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section section-components"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / PARTS DEPARTMENT</span><h2>Small parts.<br/><em>Big possibilities.</em></h2></div><div class="section-side"><p>Find the boards, displays and sensors behind our projects. Checkout will open after vendor and shipping verification.</p><a class="text-link" href="/shop/">EXPLORE THE CATALOG ↗</a></div></div>
<div class="product-grid">{components.map(p=><ProductCard product={p}/>)}</div><div class="catalog-note"><span class="live-dot amber"></span> PRODUCTS ARE RESEARCH CANDIDATES; NONE ARE CURRENTLY ORDERABLE.</div></div></section>
<section class="section section-method"><div class="container method-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">03 / OUR APPROACH</span><h2>Made for<br/><em>the curious.</em></h2><p>Hardware is more fun when the hard parts are documented. We design MAKHEX around reproducible builds, not mystery product listings.</p><a href="/about/" class="text-link">WHY WE'RE BUILDING MAKHEX ↗</a></div>
<ol class="method-list"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>PICK A PROJECT</h3><p>Choose something you really want on your desk or workbench.</p></div><span>↗</span></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>KNOW YOUR PARTS</h3><p>Use mapped BOMs and honest sourcing status.</p></div><span>↗</span></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>BUILD, TEST, IMPROVE</h3><p>Record failures and share corrections that help the next maker.</p></div><span>↗</span></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="section community-callout"><div class="container community-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">OPEN CHANNEL / MAKER TO MAKER</span><h2>YOUR BUILD.<br/><em>OUR NEXT IDEA.</em></h2><p>Show your version, flag a bad pinout, or suggest the next board we should test.</p><a href="/community/" class="btn btn-light">ENTER THE COMMUNITY ↗</a></div><div class="community-art" aria-hidden="true">/*<span>hello</span><br/>world*/<i>▣</i></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
